<title>POLAND: Polish c.bank sells PLN 72 mln of 91-day NBP-bills.</title>
<headline>Polish c.bank sells PLN 72 mln of 91-day NBP-bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 72 million zlotys of its 91-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 72 million worth of the bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield was flat at 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
